# Scene1-4-6

; ========================================
; ●シーン1‐4-6
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:22_4
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_5_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:第二天早上，艾玛再次来到招待所。|#0104Adv06_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（好……！）|#0104Adv06_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛大步流星地走向【水精之室】，<br>打算再次调查地下的设施。|#0104Adv06_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这时，有人出现在她面前。|#0104Adv06_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:等一等。|#0104Adv06_Nanoka001| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香挡住艾玛的去路。|#0104Adv06_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香！？|#0104Adv06_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你这是想去哪里？|#0104Adv06_Nanoka002| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香面无表情地问道。<br>艾玛无法从她的态度猜测出她的想法。|#0104Adv06_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛脸上闪过一丝不安的神色，但她马上恢复了平静。|#0104Adv06_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:呃……我想去【水精之室】。|#0104Adv06_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:去那里干什么？|#0104Adv06_Nanoka003| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我想调查一下里面。|#0104Adv06_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:昨晚你在【水精之室】待了很久。<br>那房间也没多大，<br>有什么需要花这么多时间去查？|#0104Adv06_Nanoka004| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:昨天你也一直看着我啊……|#0104Adv06_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:谁叫你慌慌张张地往那里冲。<br>肯定需要关注一下对吧。|#0104Adv06_Nanoka005| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:【水精之室】里有什么？|#0104Adv06_Nanoka006| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……|#0104Adv06_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛不知道该怎样回答。<br>昨晚看到的囚犯名册在脑海里一闪而过。|#0104Adv06_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（奈叶香到底是什么人……我能相信她吗……？）|#0104Adv06_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但这个疑惑也在瞬间烟消云散。|#0104Adv06_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:过去自己就是因为猜忌怀疑，<br>无法彻底相信对方，而酿成了恶果。|#0104Adv06_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（奈叶香是同伴，我相信她）|#0104Adv06_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:……我在水精之室里发现了一个暗室。<br>而这个暗室联通着位于地下的神秘设施……|#0104Adv06_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:！真的吗？|#0104Adv06_Nanoka007| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯、嗯。|#0104Adv06_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我也想一起去。<br>……只是觉得，既然那房间是藏起来的，<br>那么那里应该是个对监牢来说不便公开的地方。|#0104Adv06_Nanoka008| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们两个人一起去说不定会有危险，<br>随时都有可能被那些猫头鹰发现。|#0104Adv06_Nanoka009| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:有可能……<br>那我在外面把风好了。|#0104Adv06_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我来告诉你怎样到暗室去。<br>啊，地下设施里面很冷，像冷冻库似的，<br>你要小心。|#0104Adv06_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香带着一丝始料不及的表情<br>紧盯着艾玛。|#0104Adv06_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……你这么相信我，真的好吗。|#0104Adv06_Nanoka010| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Smile1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:你是我们的同伴嘛。<br>既然我们处境相同，就该互相帮助才对。|#0104Adv06_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:听到艾玛笑着说出这句话，<br>奈叶香的表情一下子缓和了起来。|#0104Adv06_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……樱羽艾玛，你人还真好。|#0104Adv06_Nanoka011| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:明白了。我的身后就交给你守护了。<br>但我希望你不要误会。这是交易。|#0104Adv06_Nanoka012| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:交易……？|#0104Adv06_Ema014| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我是在利用你。<br>所以要是发生什么意外你也要利用我。|#0104Adv06_Nanoka013| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:别说什么利用不利用的……|#0104Adv06_Ema015| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……|#0104Adv06_Nanoka014| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:不等艾玛说完，奈叶香就快步走了起来。<br>艾玛追上了她。|#0104Adv06_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:……说好了，<br>我会相信奈叶香到底。|#0104Adv06_Ema016| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:既然你相信我，肯把身后交给我来守护……<br>那我也会相信奈叶香。|#0104Adv06_Ema017| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你说的交易……就是这么回事对吧！|#0104Adv06_Ema018| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:……呼。|#0104Adv06_Nanoka015| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香轻轻地吐了一口气。|#0104Adv06_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果是跟你们一起的话……|#0104Adv06_Nanoka016| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:保持着背对艾玛的姿势，奈叶香喃喃说道。|#0104Adv06_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:欸？|#0104Adv06_Ema019| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:……没什么，快走吧。<br>这附近的瘴气很浓重。|#0104Adv06_Nanoka017| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:因为，在很久很久以前，魔女在这一带受到了人类残酷的对待。|#0104Adv06_Nanoka018| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:你说的魔女是指……<br>以前曾经居住在这座监牢里的魔女……？|#0104Adv06_Ema020| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:没错。只要触碰到怀有强烈念想和感情的物品时，<br>我就能看到一点……<br>在很久很久以前，一群魔女在这座监牢大宅生活的片段。|#0104Adv06_Nanoka019| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

[PrintTextModified Text:那段惨痛的历史……|#0104Adv06_Nanoka020| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:——奈叶香向艾玛诉说起<br>自己凭借幻视的魔法得来的信息。|#0104Adv06_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_36_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:当时以大魔女为集体中心，<br>一群魔女在这座岛上和睦平静地生活。|#0104Adv06_Nanoka021| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但最后被另一个种族……<br>被我们【人类】发现了这座岛屿。|#0104Adv06_Nanoka022| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:魔女希望能跟人类和平相处……<br>可人类并不这样想。|#0104Adv06_Nanoka023| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:人类一直提防魔女，<br>还打算除去这个跟自己不一样的种族。|#0104Adv06_Nanoka024| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然后——大魔女的抵抗最终徒劳无功，<br>这座岛屿被人类侵占了。|#0104Adv06_Nanoka025| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:他们肯定是利用了<br>魔女想要和平相处的心来使诈吧。|#0104Adv06_Nanoka026| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:后来，人类一直对魔女做了很多非常，<br>非常残忍的事情……|#0104Adv06_Nanoka027| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我没有同情她们。这可跟我们没关系。|#0104Adv06_Nanoka028| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:22_4
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:嘴上这么说，但奈叶香的表情却看着有些许难过。|#0104Adv06_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; 【魔女図鑑】『エマのメモ４』入手
; ========================================
@UpdateWitchBook Id:12 Category:Note Version:1

; ========================================
; 時間経過
; ========================================

[PrintTextModified Text:——跟奈叶香大致说明了一下如何到达地下的隐藏设施后，<br>艾玛独自回到了原来的地方。|#0104Adv06_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; ◎回想シーン（新規）
; ========================================
; 入る直前

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_21_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Rotation:,,0 Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} TintColor:#b0a080 Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:22_4
