@Wait WaitMode:0.9


@ModifyCharacterExtended TintColor:#b0a080 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:现在是8点……<br>如果过了两个小时我还没回来，<br>你就忘了今晚跟我来过这里的事吧。|#0104Adv06_Nanoka029| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended TintColor:#b0a080 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:欸……！？<br>你别说这种话……！|#0104Adv06_Ema021| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended TintColor:#b0a080 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:……没事的。<br>我一定会找出幕后黑手的证据，<br>然后回到这里来。|#0104Adv06_Nanoka030| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

; ========================================
; 回想ここまで
; ========================================

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Rotation:,,0 Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} TintColor:#FFFFFF Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:22_4
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:从艾玛站在这里把风开始，<br>已经过了相当长的一段时间。|#0104Adv06_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:到目前为止，她还没遇到过<br>典狱长或者看守，以及监视的猫头鹰。|#0104Adv06_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（已经10点了吗……<br>　差不多到时间了，<br>　奈叶香她还好吗……？）|#0104Adv06_Ema022|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我是不是也应该下去看看<br>　比较好）|#0104Adv06_Ema023|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛心里忐忑得很。她在附近不停地来回走动，<br>最后取出了手机。|#0104Adv06_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我又搞砸了……<br>　早知道就先跟奈叶香交换一下联系方式）|#0104Adv06_Ema024|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看着手机，艾玛才终于发现自己犯了粗心的毛病。<br>她轻轻叹了一口气。|#0104Adv06_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; フクロウの通知音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_14 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:就在这时，手机发出一个提示音，<br>吓得艾玛手一抖，差点没把手机摔地上。|#0104Adv06_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:好不容易拿稳手机后，艾玛点开了信息。<br>那是典狱长发来的。|#0104Adv06_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"『唉……这都第几次了呢。<br>　又发生了一起令人痛心的凶杀案』|#0104Adv06_Narrative024|" RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:『请大家立刻到审判庭集合』|#0104Adv06_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:『我觉得让大家亲自过来看看会更直接些……』|#0104Adv06_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛顿时觉得后背一阵冰冷，<br>目光呆滞地望着手机屏幕。|#0104Adv06_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:凶杀案，怎么、会这样……到底，是谁……|#0104Adv06_Ema025| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:仍存活的少女们的身影<br>逐一在艾玛的脑海里闪过。|#0104Adv06_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然后，她回过头看了看【水精之室】。<br>目前没有任何奈叶香准备出来的迹象。|#0104Adv06_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛站在原地犹豫了一阵子。<br>她现在应该在这继续等待奈叶香呢？<br>还是应该去审判庭呢？|#0104Adv06_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可是，既然有人遇害了，<br>艾玛和在世的少女们就有必要知道，目前究竟是什么情况。|#0104Adv06_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:最后，她决定赶紧返回监牢。|#0104Adv06_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

